<title>UK: Bankruptcies in England, Wales fall in 1996 - KPMG.</title>
<headline>Bankruptcies in England, Wales fall in 1996 - KPMG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankruptcies in England and Wales were 21 percent lower in 1996 compared with the 1995, auditors KPMG said in a statement.</p>
<p>			1996	     1995	    yr-ago qtr/mth</p>
<p> RECEIVERSHIPS    1,389	    1,755	    2,040</p>
<p> Pct change</p>
<p> BANKRUPTCIES	  21		 14		 28</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
